flowchart TD
  claim[Claim text]
  search[Claim Search]
  analyze[Claim Analyze]
  splitter[Element splitter]
  vocab[Vocabulary prediction]
  retrieval[Per-element retrieval]
  locate[Claim Locate]
  owntargets[Your own targets]
  mcptools[MCP claim tools]
  chart[Claim Chart]
  verdicts[Verdicts and sidecar]
  examiner[Human examiner]
  anchors[Anchors or candidates]
  pseudo[Pseudo-claims]
  loopscript[Pseudo-claim loop script]
  synonymize[Synonymize]
  score[Loop score]
  claimsloop[Claims loop]

  claim -->|model extracts terms| search
  claim -->|search, then analyze| analyze
  claim -->|deterministic split| splitter
  claim -->|agent supplies words| mcptools
  splitter -->|model predicts words| vocab
  vocab -->|rarity search, no quorum| retrieval
  retrieval -->|no targets given| chart
  retrieval -->|per-element arm, CLI only| analyze
  retrieval -->|model selects, verify, navigate| locate
  locate -->|a person passes targets| chart
  owntargets -->|targets flag| chart
  chart -->|model fills cells| verdicts
  verdicts -->|a person checks citations| examiner
  anchors -->|drafted from| pseudo
  pseudo -->|claims-only file| loopscript
  loopscript -->|rewrites wording| synonymize
  synonymize -->|blind chart| chart
  loopscript -->|blind chart| chart
  chart -->|sidecar vs anchors| score
  pseudo -->|pseudo chart plus ranked list| claimsloop

%% tip: Claim Chart :: The core deliverable: one row per element. CLI only at this commit.
%% tip: Claim Analyze :: CLI: whole-claim search plus a per-element arm. GUI: analyzes one top function.
%% tip: Pseudo-claims :: A drafting and self-test feature, not the front end of the pipeline. A real claim enters at Claim text.
%% tip: Claims loop :: Fills pseudo-claim chart cells and writes a _looped.md file. It does not run Claim Chart.
%% tip: a person passes targets :: Depends on a person: --targets-out writes a file, and someone hands it to --targets.
%% tip: a person checks citations :: Depends on a person: the chart asks for every citation to be verified.
